35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire. That is a lot.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The sign-in sheets show a quarter of members do two-thirds of the work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The rota confirms it. The same nine people set up and lock up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Chasing individual payments took six hours a month. That is a huge burden.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Nine people left the taster evening because they did not want a whole year commitment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if chasing money takes so long, a flat fee might be better for the books.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, if only nine people do the work, should they pay less? Or more?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, if they do the work, they should not be penalized for showing up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, a flat fee is easier to manage, but it might scare off new people.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mio, the taster forms say people are afraid of a big upfront cost.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,The bank statements show many people needed reminders. A flat fee might reduce that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The weekday turnout dropped when we had door charges. People stopped feeling it was theirs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we charge per event, the quiet members will feel even more excluded.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations. That is inefficient and stressful.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The quiet members at the winter social felt uneasy about the cost per visit.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think a flat fee is the most stable for our finances.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I worry a flat fee might make people feel they are paying for things they do not use.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I want a system that rewards the people who actually show up and help.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I prefer a system that is easy to manage and does not burn out the treasurer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I want a system that is welcoming and does not make newcomers feel overwhelmed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
